# armour/woman/plate_hang: the woman's plate tassets (short): two rigid plates over the thighs below her fauld (her
# torso holds the last lame), cut to her hips; they hinge and never bend: `wide` opens them over the stride, `flare` trails
# them a pixel, the lie lays them along the thighs. Seated keys keep the rest plates. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body woman
role armour plate
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys hang
z 10

view D key rest origin 6 -1
|.vyyyyxxxwv.
|vyyyxvvxxxwv
|vxxxwvvwwwwv
|vvvvvv.vvvvv

